Parallel function-call stacks
=============================

CALL-AS-RUNNER needs its own *MLAMBDA-CALL-STACK* array, not only a binding
of the variable to a shared array. MLAMBDA pushes five fields per frame,
changes the fill pointer and grows the adjustable vector. Sharing that
storage allows concurrent calls to overwrite frames or decrement the fill
pointer below zero.

SPECIALS-TO-BIND captures the caller's stack. COPY-PARALLEL-CALL-STACK copies
its active sequence into an independent adjustable vector, preserving the
fill pointer and capacity. CALL-AS-RUNNER binds that copy inside captured
bindings, so native workers inherit active caller frames, including through
nested parallel regions. Caller participation and one-runner fallback use
the same rule. A runner may reuse its array across several items; normal
MLAMBDA entry and unwinding balance each item's frames.

This fixes call-stack storage. It does not isolate arbitrary Maxima variable
value cells: BLOCK locals and function parameters need separate work. It
also makes no promise about debugger mutation of objects referenced by
inherited frames or unmarked foreign Lisp threads.

Run in a fresh process, with a timeout and --no-init:

  ./maxima-local --no-init --batch-string='run_testsuite(tests=["rtest_parallel_lifecycle"]);'

Require all 67 examples and the completed suite summary; a Lisp error may
exit zero. The 20 new examples append without shifting previous problem
numbers or changing mathematical expectations. PARALLEL-CALLSTACK-CHECK.LISP
uses the existing PARALLEL-INPUT-CHECK.LISP execution-site helper.

Checks cover distinct storage and inherited frames, empty/full arrays,
adjustment, caller preservation, nested caller/worker combinations, errors
and nonlocal exits. A fixed private generator exercises 64 frame/capacity
combinations. Scratch mutations are unwound between items of the same runner.

Three native checks hold two actual MLAMBDA frames active together using
handshakes, rather than depending on scheduling luck. Their functions have
no Maxima parameters, separating the stack defect from the value-cell defect.
Both runners must retain their own frame and inherited prefix. B unwinds
before A, keeping the old negative control from corrupting the test image.
The checks have deadlines, release cancellation paths, join workers and
restore the temporary Lisp function hook. CLISP exercises portable fallback
storage/nesting properties instead of claiming a native race check.
